[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":58},["ShallowReactive",2],{"module-Test-NoWarnings":3},{"generatedAt":4,"module":5,"related":50,"aliases":57},"2026-11-22T13:28:36.449Z",{"name":6,"version":7,"repo":8,"path":9,"section":10,"short":11,"description":12,"website":13,"source":14,"entered":15,"updated":16,"depends":17,"dependents":20,"bringsAlong":23,"questions":24,"lastChange":25,"history":30},"Test-NoWarnings","1.04","other","perl\u002FTest-NoWarnings","perl","Make sure you didn't emit any warnings while testing","In general, your tests shouldn't produce warnings. This modules causes\nany warnings to be captured and stored. It automatically adds an extra\ntest that will run when your script ends to check that there were no\nwarnings. If there were any warings, the test will give a \"not ok\" and\ndiagnostics of where, when and what the warning was, including a stack\ntrace of what was going on when the it occurred.","http:\u002F\u002Fsearch.cpan.org\u002F~adamk\u002FTest-NoWarnings","http:\u002F\u002Fsearch.cpan.org\u002FCPAN\u002Fauthors\u002Fid\u002FA\u002FAD\u002FADAMK\u002FTest-NoWarnings-1.04.tar.gz","2010-04-14","2015-07-05",[18],{"module":19},"Test-Tester",[21],{"module":22},"Unicode-Stringprep",3,[],{"commit":26,"date":27,"author":28,"subject":29},"97c4904b8aafc3dd600293a5e533069371d5fec6","2018-06-28T05:45:49.000Z","Dave Brown","Lots and lots of modules: Got rid of the BUILD file, added perl TYPE. (#1104)",[31,35,40,45],{"commit":32,"date":33,"author":34,"version":7},"1a19d179df837883218d6112767936a4ae10b94d","2015-07-05T19:33:42.000Z","Dennis Veatch",{"commit":36,"date":37,"author":38,"version":39},"66866fcfa45cc21b567da1c9a937fa85f440ebbc","2011-10-08T14:47:47.000Z","Dennis `stumbles` Veatch","1.03",{"commit":41,"date":42,"author":43,"version":44},"1956c28365d27d11d9715297b13b3115435cd168","2011-01-18T19:35:57.000Z","Florin Braescu","1.02",{"commit":46,"date":47,"author":48,"version":49},"983679d0877a0f0e1c3460d613a17462478d33c2","2010-04-14T19:30:10.000Z","Zbigni